ry mode  you certainly can't be seen wearing a  mask for the first time in public that  would  imply things are not as good as you  claim they are  so that gets us to donald trump earlier  this week donald trump flew out to  arizona we covered it  covered some of his live events there he  went  literally to a mask factory a factory uh  repurposed facility of honeywell where  they are  making masks and they have in you know  right on the wall  on a tv it says mandatory masks keep a  mask on at all times  trump didn't wear a mask and once once  again we knew we suspected  based on what we know about trump that  this is more management by optics trump  wearing a mask when he says we've  basically won  we're past it we're reopening it's all  great he succeeded at keeping the death  toll  well below 2 million it doesn't send the  right signal and indeed that's exactly  what the new report says trump  believes that if he was seen wearing a  mask it would hurt his chances of  reelection it would make him look  ridiculous trump has said to advisers  that wearing a mask would quote  send the wrong message and it would make  him seem  preoccupied with health i  for me it would be good i would love to  see trump preoccupied  with health that's the problem the  problem is he seems not to care about  health  trump also has told confidance according  to the same associated press report  that he fears he would look ridiculous  in a mask  and that the image of him wearing a mask  would be used in negative ads  against him understand the insanity of  that  the mask has become a proxy  political statement at this point in  time if you wear a mask it means you  believe this is serious you believe  things are bad  you believe people should be scared not  wearing a mask means  you don't trust these hoaxer governors  or everything's fine or the economy will  soon be open  and people will soon or have already  stopped dying  from coronavirus it's now a political  statement something that 